% technique_id: T1110.004
% technique_name: Credential Stuffing
% domain: enterprise
% tactic(s): credential-access
% platforms: Windows;SaaS;IaaS;Linux;macOS;Containers;Network Devices;Office Suite;Identity Provider;ESXi
